:::text id=txt_hdr_s3 at=top-left width=80% height=80 offsetX=80 offsetY=56 preset=title align=left color=text fontSize=38
# How We Connect — Communication Preferences & Rules
:::

:::shape id=card_left at=top-left width=530 height=480 offsetX=80 offsetY=160 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_chan at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=104 offsetY=180 name=message-square size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_chan at=top-left width=480 height=210 offsetX=104 offsetY=224 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=15
**Preferred Channels:**  
Slack/Teams (Chat): Best for non-mentally taxing and quick info exchange.  
Face-to-Face or Call: Best for complex/misunderstood topics.  
Email: Best for official decisions or third-party communications.
:::

:::text id=txt_bound at=top-left width=480 height=180 offsetX=104 offsetY=440 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=15
**Boundaries:**  
Context upfront: Context provided upfront unless mutual understanding is established.  
One at a time: Only handle one face-to-face or live call conversation at a time.
:::

:::shape id=card_right at=top-left width=530 height=480 offsetX=670 offsetY=160 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_step at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=694 offsetY=184 name=list-ordered size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_step at=top-left width=480 height=380 offsetX=694 offsetY=232 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=16
**Standard 3-Step Format:**
1. Context (facts only) — Shared facts first
2. Problem definition — Define issue & impact
3. Proposed solutions (if any) — Actionable choices
:::
